flowchart TB
    Approved[[CIBLE LAB APPROUVEE T03<br/>second projet = staging CAP-05<br/>pas de green production, HA de zone ou DR revendique]]

    Admin[Administrateur]
    Dev[Developpeur]
    User[Utilisateur synthetique]
    GitHubId[GitHub SSO + MFA<br/>Teleport Community]
    AppId[Keycloak OIDC lab<br/>identites synthetiques]
    GitHub[GitHub Actions + depot GitOps]
    GHCR[GHCR<br/>digest + provenance]
    ExternalS3[(Cible S3 compatible externe<br/>requise mais non fournie par OpenStack<br/>a qualifier avant T15)]

    subgraph OPENSTACK[OpenStack prive - deux projets et une seule AZ nova]
        Provider[Reseau provider partage prive<br/>aucun L3, LB, Cinder ou objet]

        subgraph SOURCE[Projet source - production-like]
            Bastion[Bastion 1 vCPU / 1 Go<br/>Teleport lab mesure en T06<br/>SSH break-glass conserve]
            Current[AS-IS preserve pendant T05-T17<br/>K3s Flannel + applications]
            PG[(PostgreSQL VM conservee<br/>TLS + pgBackRest/PITR en T10)]
            Future[Production lab reconstruite apres T17<br/>K3s + Cilium/Hubble<br/>fondation repetee sur staging]
        end

        subgraph STAGING[Projet secondaire - staging uniquement 4 vCPU / 8 Go]
            StageCP[Control plane K3s<br/>2 vCPU / 4 Go]
            StageWorker[Worker K3s<br/>2 vCPU / 4 Go]
            Cilium[Cilium + Hubble<br/>default-deny]
            Envoy[Gateway API + Envoy<br/>NodePort prive + TLS]
            Argo[Argo CD non HA]
            Policy[PSA + Kyverno]
            Secrets[OpenBao Raft mono-noeud<br/>+ External Secrets]
            Identity[Keycloak mono-noeud]
            StageApps[3 applications<br/>donnees synthetiques]
            Cache[Valkey cache]
            Bus[NATS JetStream mono-noeud]
            Obs[Prometheus + Alertmanager<br/>Grafana + Loki + Tempo + OTel]
        end
    end

    Admin --> GitHubId --> Bastion
    Admin -. secours audite .-> Bastion
    Bastion --> Current
    Bastion --> StageCP

    Dev --> GitHub --> GHCR
    GitHub --> Argo
    GHCR --> Argo --> StageApps
    User --> AppId --> Envoy --> StageApps

    StageCP --- StageWorker
    Cilium --- StageCP
    Cilium --- StageWorker
    Policy -. admission .-> StageApps
    Secrets --> StageApps
    Identity --> StageApps
    StageApps --> Cache
    StageApps --> Bus
    StageApps --> Obs

    Provider --- Current
    Provider --- StageCP
    Provider --- StageWorker
    Current -. reconstruction finale .-> Future
    PG --- Current
    PG --- Future

    PG -->|base backups + WAL| ExternalS3
    Secrets -->|snapshot| ExternalS3
    StageCP -->|Velero/Kopia| ExternalS3

    Rollback[[ROLLBACK<br/>source intact jusqu aux tests T17<br/>backups T04/T15 avant reconstruction]]
    Current -. chemin de repli .-> Rollback
    Future -. restauration K3s + retour entree .-> Rollback
    Approved -. gouverne .-> OPENSTACK

